<title>USA: Dalton, Ga., repriced, top yield 5.60 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>Dalton, Ga., repriced, top yield 5.60 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
